 his picnic will take the place of our regularly scheduled second-Wednesday
 -of-the-month August meeting. Some business will be covered\, but the bulk
  of the evening will be dedicated to fun! Wednesday—August 12\, from 5-8
  PM. The picnic is at Huffnagle Park\, located along Oak Lane\, between So
 uth C
