  it very clear that she is NOT accepting money from corporate PACs. This m
 eans that her campaign is mainly donor-funded and every dollar and cent co
 unts! The "Change for Change" fundraiser will be held at Levengoods of 
LOCATION:Levengoods of Lancaster\, 219 W Walnut St\, Lancaster\, PA\, 1760
 3
